    "summary": "In this transcript, a user expresses deep existential exhaustion, feelings of incompetence, and a desire to \"opt out\" of life to escape overwhelming pressure. The AI assistant responds by validating the user's feelings of being overwhelmed and drowning, but ultimately directs the user toward the idea that they are not alone and that help is available.",
